// HZM coop - subtle WET DEATH-RATTLE / bleed-out gurgle SFX (converted .ogg -> .wav, 22050 mono).
// 12 aliases (coop_gurgle1..12) pooled + played at random, quietly and positionally, near a fresh
// corpse a beat AFTER death (see coop_mod/gurgle.scr) so the wet gurgle rides the tier-2 blood
// bleed-out. Curated wet death-rattle SFX - the darkest / quietest / lowest-frequency last-breath
// takes (light lowpass + soft fades so they read as an internal wet bleed, not a fresh cry).
// Auto-registered (any ubersound/*.scr is loaded by the engine).
// Format: soundparms <vol> <volMod> <pitch> <pitchMod> <minDist> <maxDist> <channel> <load> maps
// Tuned QUIETER (vol 0.55 vs the 1.0 death grunt) and SHORT-RANGE (150..1200 vs 500..2200) so it
// is a close, intimate, "lean over the body" sound - off-screen corpses stay silent (proximity gate too).
// channel 'auto' = 3D positional; 'loaded' = in-memory (instant).

alias coop_gurgle1 sound/coop_gurgle/cg_gurgle1.wav soundparms 0.55 0.15 1.0 0.12 150 1200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_gurgle2 sound/coop_gurgle/cg_gurgle2.wav soundparms 0.55 0.15 1.0 0.12 150 1200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_gurgle3 sound/coop_gurgle/cg_gurgle3.wav soundparms 0.55 0.15 1.0 0.12 150 1200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_gurgle4 sound/coop_gurgle/cg_gurgle4.wav soundparms 0.55 0.15 1.0 0.12 150 1200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_gurgle5 sound/coop_gurgle/cg_gurgle5.wav soundparms 0.55 0.15 1.0 0.12 150 1200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_gurgle6 sound/coop_gurgle/cg_gurgle6.wav soundparms 0.55 0.15 1.0 0.12 150 1200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_gurgle7 sound/coop_gurgle/cg_gurgle7.wav soundparms 0.55 0.15 1.0 0.12 150 1200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_gurgle8 sound/coop_gurgle/cg_gurgle8.wav soundparms 0.55 0.15 1.0 0.12 150 1200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_gurgle9 sound/coop_gurgle/cg_gurgle9.wav soundparms 0.55 0.15 1.0 0.12 150 1200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_gurgle10 sound/coop_gurgle/cg_gurgle10.wav soundparms 0.55 0.15 1.0 0.12 150 1200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_gurgle11 sound/coop_gurgle/cg_gurgle11.wav soundparms 0.55 0.15 1.0 0.12 150 1200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_gurgle12 sound/coop_gurgle/cg_gurgle12.wav soundparms 0.55 0.15 1.0 0.12 150 1200 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"

// HZM coop - WET BLOOD-LEAK LOOP (continuous under-body trickle on a bleeding corpse; separate from
// the occasional death-rattle gurgle above - both can play on the same body). Copied from the retail
// oil-barrel leak wav (sound/mechanics/Mec_WaterLoop_03.wav, retail alias 'liquid_leak') so we own the
// volume/range: TUNED QUIET (vol 0.4) and SHORT-RANGE (minDist 120, maxDist 900) with no pitch/vol
// variation so it reads as a steady, intimate trickle - off-screen corpses stay silent (proximity gate
// too). 3.49s mono loop, looped positionally via 'loopsound coop_bloodleak' (see coop_mod/gurgle.scr::leak).
alias coop_bloodleak sound/coop_gurgle/coop_bloodleak.wav soundparms 0.4 0.0 1.0 0.0 120 900 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
